{"3988410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Phantom Tower", "steam_appid": 3988410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantom Tower</strong> is an action RPG inspired by classic hack and slash games, where frenetic combat, character progression, and the hunt for ever more powerful equipment are at the heart of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers from all over the world gather at the foot of the mysterious Phantom Tower in search of glory, riches, and power. Many have attempted the climb, but none have ever reached the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/91903ce1b00929b055c09b9bd811b555.poster.avif?t=1785400560\" width=640 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/91903ce1b00929b055c09b9bd811b555.webm?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/91903ce1b00929b055c09b9bd811b555.mp4?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the tower's walls lie treasures of all kinds: forgotten relics, legendary weapons, and precious resources. Every expedition is an opportunity to grow stronger, find better equipment, and push ever higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/ae05dba5f859712cf709de7707fcd954.poster.avif?t=1785400560\" width=640 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/ae05dba5f859712cf709de7707fcd954.webm?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/ae05dba5f859712cf709de7707fcd954.mp4?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your equipment, develop your combat style, and face hordes of increasingly dangerous enemies. Discover the Tower's Blessings, powerful abilities hidden across its floors, and create the perfect combination to adapt to challenges and defeat ever stronger opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/37445ff1a6f16d71faf60951d91fc699.poster.avif?t=1785400560\" width=640 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/37445ff1a6f16d71faf60951d91fc699.webm?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/37445ff1a6f16d71faf60951d91fc699.mp4?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phantom Tower features two game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Climb Mode</strong>, the game's main mode, you can explore the tower collecting materials, resources, and equipment to bring back outside. With what you recover, you can forge new weapons, upgrade your gear, and prepare to reach higher and higher floors of the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/002cdacc11278046cf40c8fb3d4300b5.poster.avif?t=1785400560\" width=640 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/002cdacc11278046cf40c8fb3d4300b5.webm?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/002cdacc11278046cf40c8fb3d4300b5.mp4?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Survival Mode</strong>, you can put your experience to the test by facing infinite hordes of monsters, choosing your equipment, and trying to survive as long as possible. Every defeat, however, is final.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/9512763f56e6648806979545aac034c8.poster.avif?t=1785400560\" width=640 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/9512763f56e6648806979545aac034c8.webm?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/9512763f56e6648806979545aac034c8.mp4?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantom Tower</strong> is an action RPG inspired by classic hack and slash games, where frenetic combat, character progression, and the hunt for ever more powerful equipment are at the heart of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers from all over the world gather at the foot of the mysterious Phantom Tower in search of glory, riches, and power. Many have attempted the climb, but none have ever reached the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/91903ce1b00929b055c09b9bd811b555.poster.avif?t=1785400560\" width=640 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/91903ce1b00929b055c09b9bd811b555.webm?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/91903ce1b00929b055c09b9bd811b555.mp4?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the tower's walls lie treasures of all kinds: forgotten relics, legendary weapons, and precious resources. Every expedition is an opportunity to grow stronger, find better equipment, and push ever higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/ae05dba5f859712cf709de7707fcd954.poster.avif?t=1785400560\" width=640 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/ae05dba5f859712cf709de7707fcd954.webm?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/ae05dba5f859712cf709de7707fcd954.mp4?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your equipment, develop your combat style, and face hordes of increasingly dangerous enemies. Discover the Tower's Blessings, powerful abilities hidden across its floors, and create the perfect combination to adapt to challenges and defeat ever stronger opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/37445ff1a6f16d71faf60951d91fc699.poster.avif?t=1785400560\" width=640 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/37445ff1a6f16d71faf60951d91fc699.webm?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/37445ff1a6f16d71faf60951d91fc699.mp4?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phantom Tower features two game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Climb Mode</strong>, the game's main mode, you can explore the tower collecting materials, resources, and equipment to bring back outside. With what you recover, you can forge new weapons, upgrade your gear, and prepare to reach higher and higher floors of the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/002cdacc11278046cf40c8fb3d4300b5.poster.avif?t=1785400560\" width=640 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/002cdacc11278046cf40c8fb3d4300b5.webm?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/002cdacc11278046cf40c8fb3d4300b5.mp4?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Survival Mode</strong>, you can put your experience to the test by facing infinite hordes of monsters, choosing your equipment, and trying to survive as long as possible. Every defeat, however, is final.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/9512763f56e6648806979545aac034c8.poster.avif?t=1785400560\" width=640 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/9512763f56e6648806979545aac034c8.webm?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988410/extras/9512763f56e6648806979545aac034c8.mp4?t=1785400560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_